  "prefLabel": "Arch 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "priorExpiration": "1995-04-13",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Arch 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 310-A:28-52 which include but are not limited to safeguarding property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity, skills and practice in the profession of architecture in this state.\n\nSource. #3029, eff 5-28-85; ss by #4599, eff 4-13-89, EXPIRED: 4-13-95\n\nNew. #6136, eff 12-1-95; ss by #7942, eff 8-27-03",
